_title":"黄李吕马王张传第十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0092.xhtml","index":161,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":17,"end":31,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"huangli-q-678b70bca9ddf84b3d08","section":"chapter-043","block":"b-c07b80607e4db3042648","layer":"original","quote":"平特见崇显，加拜参军，统五部兼当营事〖2〗，进位讨寇将军，封亭侯","section_title":"黄李吕马王张传第十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0092.xhtml","index":159,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":117,"end":149,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"huangli-q-6a451b901c117b47876c","section":"chapter-043","block":"b-3657f1a30bcb7d8b79da","layer":"modern","quote":"〖8〗六年：延熙六年（公元 243）。","attribution":"现代注释","section_title":"黄李吕马王张传第十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0092.xhtml","index":176,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-aa5e8a287f7f3ee48e5d","start":0,"end":19,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"huangli-q-79957c676e40095b7073","section":"chapter-043","block":"b-486f9fcee6c41bd3de4a","layer":"original","quote":"从曹公征汉中","section_title":"黄李吕马王张传第十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0092.xhtml","index":157,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":39,"end":45,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"huangli-q-8bf7c6db5590fc0ed2c2","section":"chapter-043","block":"b-486f9fcee6c41bd3de4a","layer":"original","quote":"随杜濩、朴胡诣洛阳，假校尉","section_title":"黄李吕马王张传第十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0092.xhtml","index":157,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":25,"end":38,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"huangli-q-8d40ffa2436b587c016c","section":"chapter-043","block":"b-aaee59131dac67f8709d","layer":"original","quote":"张郃攻平，平坚守不动，郃不能克","section_title":"黄李吕马王张传第十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0092.xhtml","index":160,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":28,"end":43,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"huangli-q-8f70414a41aba2d4ce93","section":"chapter-043","block":"b-c07b80607e4db3042648","layer":"original","quote":"平连规谏谡，谡不能用","section_title":"黄李吕马王张传第十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0092.xhtml","index":159,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":24,"end":34,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"huangli-q-ae68fe210323ebf83b11","section":"chapter-043","block":"b-f96cf5cd7e02c882caab","layer":"original","quote":"平曰：“不然！汉中去涪垂千里。贼若得关，便为祸也。今宜先遣刘护军、杜参军据兴势，平为后拒；若贼分向黄金〖14〗，平率千人下自临之；比尔间，涪军行至：此计之上也","section_title":"黄李吕马王张传第十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0092.xhtml","index":165,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":79,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"huangli-q-bda36a777a2995280650","section":"chapter-043","block":"b-7d97dc27414a2eebffb2","layer":"original","quote":"因降先主，拜牙门将，裨将军","section_title":"黄李吕马王张传第十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0092.xhtml","index":158,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":13,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"huangli-q-c17dcd424ae69fe98562","section":"chapter-043","block":"b-c07b80607e4db3042648","layer":"original","quote":"丞相亮既诛马谡及将军张休、李盛，夺将军黄袭等兵","section_title":"黄李吕马王张传第十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0092.xhtml","index":159,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":93,"end":116,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"huangli-q-c2c96f5c8c0cf2976890","section":"chapter-043","block":"b-5f67fa12f201801eded1","layer":"modern","quote":"〖20〗十一年：延熙十一年（公元 248）。王平的坟墓，相传在今四川南充市永安乡临江村。现尚有墓冢、碑碣留存。","attribution":"现代注释","section_title":"黄李吕马王张传第十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0092.xhtml","index":188,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-78cf997e2377137d1143","start":0,"end":55,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"huangli-q-cb50c70060b9dbdd4ff9","section":"chapter-043","block":"b-c07b80607e4db3042648","layer":"original","quote":"谡舍水上山，举措烦扰","section_title":"黄李吕马王张传第十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0092.xhtml","index":159,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":13,"end":23,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"huangli-q-d1735a694936d3c0a8cf","section":"chapter-043","block":"b-aaee59131dac67f8709d","layer":"original","quote":"九年〖3〗，亮围祁山，平别守南围","section_title":"黄李吕马王张传第十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0092.xhtml","index":160,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":16,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"huangli-q-d188eddba54126379f10","section":"chapter-043","block":"b-b11ee1fc4d2478105ae4","layer":"original","quote":"迁后典军、安汉将军〖5〗，副车骑将军吴壹住汉中；又领汉中太守","section_title":"黄李吕马王张传第十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0092.xhtml","index":161,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":32,"end":62,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"huangli-q-d93fb00a0e39c932cd7f","section":"chapter-043","block":"b-c07b80607e4db3042648","layer":"original","quote":"于是平徐徐收合诸营遗迸〖1〗，率将士而还","section_title":"黄李吕马王张传第十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0092.xhtml","index":159,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":72,"end":92,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"huangli-q-eab65dfa414d83bb2fa7","section":"chapter-043","block":"b-f96cf5cd7e02c882caab","layer":"original","quote":"涪诸军及大将军费祎，自成都相继而至，魏军退还，如平本策","section_title":"黄李吕马王张传第十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0092.xhtml","index":165,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":96,"end":123,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"huangli-q-ec683034033dae302667","section":"chapter-043","block":"b-c07b80607e4db3042648","layer":"original","quote":"惟平所领千人，鸣鼓自持。魏将张郃疑其伏兵，不往逼也","section_title":"黄李吕马王张传第十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0092.xhtml","index":159,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":46,"end":71,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"huangli-q-fe812bf03b9d2df618d3","section":"chapter-043","block":"b-aaee59131dac67f8709d","layer":"original","quote":"魏大将军司马宣王攻亮","section_title":"黄李吕马王张传第十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0092.xhtml","index":160,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":17,"end":27,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"huangli-q-fe915ae23e70ef508718","section":"chapter-043","block":"b-eeece5f7b734fad61b54","layer":"original","quote":"明年，亮出祁山；忠诣亮所，经营戎事","section_title":"黄李吕马王张传第十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0092.xhtml","index":127,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":97,"end":114,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"jfj-q0078","section":"chapter-044","block":"b-4725e01fbb9285c8b22d","layer":"original","quote":"刘敏，左护军〖15〗，扬威将军。与镇北大将军王平俱镇汉中。","section_title":"蒋琬费祎姜维传第十四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0094.xhtml","index":87,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":29,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"jfj-q0079","section":"chapter-044","block":"b-4725e01fbb9285c8b22d","layer":"original","quote":"刘敏，左护军〖15〗，扬威将军。与镇北大将军王平俱镇汉中。魏遣大将军曹爽袭蜀时，议者或谓“但可守城，不出拒敌，必自引退”。敏以为：“男女布野，农谷栖亩〖16〗；若听敌入，则大事去矣。”遂帅所领与平据兴势；多张旗帜，弥亘百余里〖17〗。会大将军费祎从成都至，魏军即退。敏以功封云亭侯。","section_title":"蒋琬费祎姜维传第十四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0094.xhtml","index":87,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":141,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"jfj-q0081","section":"chapter-044","block":"b-4725e01fbb9285c8b22d","layer":"original","quote":"遂帅所领与平据兴势；多张旗帜，弥亘百余里","section_title":"蒋琬费祎姜维传第十四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0094.xhtml","index":87,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":92,"end":112,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"jfj-q0082","section":"chapter-044","block":"b-4725e01fbb9285c8b22d","layer":"original","quote":"会大将军费祎从成都至，魏军即退。","section_title":"蒋琬费祎姜维传第十四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0094.xhtml","index":87,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":117,"end":133,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"jfj-q0110","section":"chapter-044","block":"b-4d3778d5046d857a6113","layer":"original","quote":"延熙七年，魏军次于兴势〖19〗；假祎节，率众往御之。","section_title":"蒋琬费祎姜维传第十四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0094.xhtml","index":112,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":26,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"jfj-q0133","section":"chapter-044","block":"b-85aae37594d28a751d2e","layer":"original","quote":"会马谡败于街亭","section_title":"蒋琬费祎姜维传第十四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0094.xhtml","index":158,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":128,"end":135,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"jfj-q0172","section":"chapter-044","block":"b-b28aa8ce5009c9675e9e","layer":"original","quote":"初，先主留魏延镇汉中，皆实兵诸围〖1〗，以御外敌；敌若来攻，使不得入。及兴势之役，王平捍拒曹爽，皆承此制。维建议以为：“错守诸围〖2〗，虽合《周易》‘重门’之义〖3〗，然适可御敌，不获大利。不若使闻敌至，诸围皆敛兵聚谷，退就汉、乐二城；使敌不得入平，且重关镇守以捍之。有事之日，令游军并进以伺其虚〖4〗；敌攻关不克，野无散谷，千里悬粮，自然疲乏。引退之日，然后诸城并出，与游军并力搏之：此殄敌之术也。”","section_title":"蒋琬费祎姜维传第十四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0094.xhtml","index":214,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":201,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"jfj-q0173","section":"chapter-044","block":"b-b28aa8ce5009c9675e9e","layer":"original","quote":"及兴势之役，王平捍拒曹爽，皆承此制。","section_title":"蒋琬费祎姜维传第十四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0094.xhtml","index":214,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":35,"end":53,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"jfj-q0228","section":"chapter-044","block":"b-1fcbe6e22b07445711e4","layer":"pei","quote":"未及遣迎冀中人，会亮前锋为张郃、费繇等所破","attribution":"《魏略》","section_title":"蒋琬费祎姜维传第十四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0094.xhtml","index":173,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-46e2cf216fe32246f7b2","start":192,"end":213,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"liuliao-q-79401dc33d26cf0fb6d3","section":"chapter-040","block":"b-585b382be8c75611e079","layer":"original","quote":"仪等槎山通道〖12〗，昼夜兼行，亦继延后。延先至，据南谷口〖13〗；遣兵逆击仪等。仪等令何平在前御延〖14〗，平叱延先登曰：“公亡，身尚未寒，汝辈何敢乃尔！”延士众知曲在延〖15〗，莫为用命，军皆散","section_title":"刘彭廖李刘魏杨传第十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0086.xhtml","index":293,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":99,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"mingdi-e-o009b-q","section":"chapter-003","block":"b-aec45ce1d329ad6dfa62","layer":"original","quote":"蜀大将诸葛亮寇边〖4〗，天水、南安、安定三郡吏民叛应亮〖5〗。﹝二﹞遣大将军曹真都督关右〖6〗，并进兵。右将军张郃击亮于街亭〖7〗，大破之。亮败走，三郡平。丁未〖8〗，行幸长安。﹝三﹞","section_title":"明帝纪第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0011.xhtml","index":55,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":92,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"mingdi-e-o021c-q","section":"chapter-003","block":"b-b3a0b254d489f1ed2693","layer":"original","quote":"五年春正月〖1〗，帝耕于籍田。三月，大司马曹真薨。诸葛亮寇天水。诏大将军司马宣王拒之。自去冬十月至此月，不雨。辛巳〖2〗，大雩〖3〗。","section_title":"明帝纪第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0011.xhtml","index":161,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":67,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"mingdi-q-b-76fba510250937628a99","section":"chapter-003","block":"b-76fba510250937628a99","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗二年：太和二年（公元 228）。","section_title":"明帝纪第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0011.xhtml","index":60,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-38a74578b09178cb1fd4","start":0,"end":19,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"mingdi-q-b-c8dc64098d12ed2b34ee","section":"chapter-003","block":"b-c8dc64098d12ed2b34ee","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗五年：太和五年（公元 231 ）。","section_title":"明帝纪第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0011.xhtml","index":167,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-99c1873dc57e954cfdf4","start":0,"end":20,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"mingdi-q-o008","section":"chapter-003","block":"b-bec9198de0001b0aa26c","layer":"original","quote":"二年春正月〖1〗，宣王攻破新城。斩达，传其首〖2〗。﹝一﹞分新城之上庸、武陵、巫县为上庸郡〖3〗，锡县为锡郡。","section_title":"明帝纪第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0011.xhtml","index":54,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":55,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"mingdi-q-o021","section":"chapter-003","block":"b-b3a0b254d489f1ed2693","layer":"original","quote":"五年春正月〖1〗，帝耕于籍田。三月，大司马曹真薨。诸葛亮寇天水。诏大将军司马宣王拒之。自去冬十月至此月，不雨。辛巳〖2〗，大雩〖3〗。","section_title":"明帝纪第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0011.xhtml","index":161,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":67,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"shaodi-e-o024b-q","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-9169f5a71887ca42dbea","layer":"original","quote":"五月，癸巳〖14〗，讲《尚书》经通〖15〗。使太常以太牢祀孔子于辟雍，以颜渊配；赐太傅、大将军及侍讲者各有差。丙午〖16〗，大将军曹爽引军还。","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_000.xhtml","index":80,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":71,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"shaodi-q-b-7eb87839c414a706f2aa","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-7eb87839c414a706f2aa","layer":"modern","quote":"〖13〗五年：正始五年（公元 244）。","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_000.xhtml","index":96,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-f0539e2dfb395a33b142","start":0,"end":20,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"shaodi-q-o022","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-93d5da2e078d5ca12eb0","layer":"original","quote":"五年春二月〖13〗，诏大将军曹爽率众征蜀。","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_000.xhtml","index":78,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":21,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xiahoucao-e-o052b-q","section":"chapter-009","block":"b-6b09c300271ca978ec28","layer":"original","quote":"诸葛亮围祁山，南安、天水、安定三郡反应亮。帝遣真督诸军，军郿；遣张郃击亮将马谡〖12〗，大破之。","section_title":"诸夏侯曹传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0023.xhtml","index":221,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":19,"end":67,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xiahoucao-e-o061b-q","section":"chapter-009","block":"b-07987637cc4b4315dd87","layer":"original","quote":"爽参军杨伟为爽陈形势：“宜急还〖12〗，不然将败。”﹝二﹞飏与伟争于爽前，伟曰：“飏、胜将败国家事〖13〗，可斩也！”爽不悦，乃引军还。","section_title":"诸夏侯曹传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0023.xhtml","index":260,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":76,"end":144,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhangle-e-o035a-q","section":"chapter-017","block":"b-1c7bb0c2a4ad2f049b9c","layer":"original","quote":"诸葛亮出祁山。加郃位特进，遣督诸军，拒亮将马谡于街亭。谡依阻南山，不下据城。郃绝其汲道〖2〗，击，大破之。南安、天水、安定郡反，应亮，郃皆破平之。诏曰：“贼亮以巴蜀之众，当虓虎之师〖3〗；将军被坚执锐，所向克定。朕甚嘉之！”益邑千户，并前四千三百户。","section_title":"张乐于张徐传第十七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0039.xhtml","index":122,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":125,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhuge-e-o033a-q","section":"chapter-035","block":"b-7d68192c0e968e4ac882","layer":"original","quote":"魏明帝西镇长安，命张郃拒亮。亮使马谡督诸军在前，与郃战于街亭〖7〗。谡违亮节度，举动失宜，大为郃所破。亮拔西县千余家〖8〗，还于汉中，﹝三﹞戮谡以谢众〖9〗。","section_title":"诸葛亮传第五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0076.xhtml","index":214,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":79,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhuge-q-o034-judgment","section":"chapter-035","block":"b-ac0a1291d9674d568ae3","layer":"original","quote":"上疏曰：“臣以弱才，叨窃非据〖10〗，亲秉旄钺以厉三军〖11〗；不能训章明法，临事而惧〖12〗；至有街亭违命之阙，箕谷不戒之失〖13〗。咎皆在臣，授任无方；臣明不知人〖14〗，恤事多暗〖15〗。《春秋》责帅〖16〗，臣职是当〖17〗；请自贬三等，以督厥咎〖18〗。”","section_title":"诸葛亮传第五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0076.xhtml","index":215,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":133,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{"houzhu-p0029":{"fields":[],"directory":{"faction":"shu"}}},"directory_counts":{}}
